From 782721461af3b13fec9840ca0fba5a69667e01a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Schiffhauer <Alexander.Schiffhauer@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:27:38 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] two-step: Add a themeable XKB on-screen keyboard

Keep geometry, layout translation and touch input separate from rendering. Support configured layout groups, one-shot modifiers, translated actions, configurable colors and custom geometry. Reserve prompt space per mapped display and restore pending prompts on late display discovery. Add geometry tests and configuration documentation.
